infinite-patch 1
# Metallic Gong Inharmonic Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 1.0
  i steps 16
  i note0 43
  i note1 50
  i note2 55
  i note3 57
